      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在静电单位制中，点电荷的电场强度"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$E=\\frac{|q|}{\\varepsilon r^2}$. (8-14)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**场的叠加原理** 两个电荷$q_1$和$q_2$对点电荷$q$的作用力",
        "的合力，等于每个电荷$q_1$和$q_2$的作用力$\\vec{F}_1$和$\\vec{F}_2$的几何和."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\vec{F}_1=q\\vec{E}_1$ 和 $\\vec{F}_2=q\\vec{E}_2$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式中$\\vec{E}_1$和$\\vec{E}_2$是电荷$q_1$和$q_2$产生的电场强度，所以，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\vec{F}=q\\vec{E}_1+q\\vec{E}_2=q(\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从这个等式可以得出：应当把几何和$\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2$**看做为电荷$q$**",
        "**所在的点的合电场强度**$\\vec{E}$(图114)："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\vec{E}=\\frac{\\vec{F}}{q}=\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这就是场的**叠加原理**."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在一般情况下，叠加原理表述为：**如果几个不同的带电**",
        "**粒子在空间某一点产生的电场强度分别为$\\vec{E}_1$、$\\vec{E}_2$、$\\vec{E}_3$等等，则**",
        "**在该点的合电场强度等于**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\vec{E}=\\vec{E}_1+\\vec{E}_2+\\vec{E}_3+\\cdots$. (8-15)"
      ]
    },
